<div class="post-header"><h1 class="post-title unpublished">White House Falsely Declared it Warned Iraq of Impending Airstrkies</h1>
<h3 class="subtitle"The National Security Council walked back White House spokesperson John Kirby’s statement last week that Iraq had advance notice of the strikes.</h3>

